<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-hypothesis/RIPEA01514B7E95B5311F-human-2-2>
  a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis;
  prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/human-reviewer/RV017>;
