  prov:wasMemberOf <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/research-integrity-assessment/RIPEA01514B7E95B5311F>;
  ripe:rationale """In WHO database, the data of first enrollment is 2015-02-02, which isn't picked up by INSPECT-AI. The data of registration is 2015-02-09 which is a week later than first enrollment. The entry also states 'No' for prospective registration. This alone may not cause concern as it's only a week out, and the dates given in paper do align with the details on the registration entry.
Hence, I agree with the INSPECT-AI suggestion. (Do note that it's unlikely that this study would progress to this check as it would have been excluded at the first stage due to serious concerns, relating to the expression of concern and multiple retractions of papers by the same research team).""";
  ripe:resultOutcome "no";
  tido:answers <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-question/study-registration/1.0.0> .

