<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-hypothesis/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087-human-1-2>
  a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis;
  prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/human-reviewer/RV012>;
  prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/evaluation/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087>;
  prov:wasMemberOf <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/research-integrity-assessment/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087>;
  ripe:rationale "While this paper has not been retracted the authors have published dubious publications, and the methods they adopted here can be misleading. As data were not shared it is not possible to rerun the analyses using different approaches. If I was working on a review, I would still include the paper if it met all inclusion criteria, but this information here would influence my critical appraisal, and I would need to acknowledge data limitations.";
  ripe:resultOutcome "unclear";
  tido:answers <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-question/post-publication-notices/1.0.0> .

<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-hypothesis/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087-human-1-3>
  a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis;
  prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/human-reviewer/RV012>;
  prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/evaluation/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087>;
  prov:wasMemberOf <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/research-integrity-assessment/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087>;
  ripe:rationale "The first, second and last authors have quite a few retracted publications and many expressions of concern. Initially I had said I would include this paper if I was doing a review on the topic and it met inclusion criteria, but now I am not so sure. The challenge is: where do we draw the line? I suppose passing the \"AI-Inspect test may in the future be used as part of the inclusion criteria - academic judgement will have to prevail nonetheless.";
  ripe:resultOutcome "yes";
  tido:answers <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-question/research-team-related-concerns/1.0.0> .

<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-hypothesis/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087-human-2-2>
  a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis;
  prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/human-reviewer/RV012>;
  prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/evaluation/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087>;
  prov:wasMemberOf <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/research-integrity-assessment/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087>;
  ripe:rationale "Full protocol was not available on the link provided. One month delay in registration is concerning but perhaps this was due to delays from the website? In theory I would only be slightly concerned, but when you see that the study finished in July it becomes a bigger issue. It is also concerning that the trial page was refreshed in 2019 and no additional data /progress was reported (even though the paper was published in 2016. Protocol stated that the first enrolment was on the 31st May 2015. Paper reports that 60 patients were recruited and intervention took 6 weeks, and the trial was conducted from May to July 2015 (note the start on the 31st May). Therefore, in about 8-9 weeks they recruited all patients and did the 6-week follow up, did all the analysis and wrote the whole paper in two months (the paper was submitted for publication on the 13th October). These are very tight timelines.";
  ripe:resultOutcome "yes";
  tido:answers <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-question/study-registration/1.0.0> .

<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-hypothesis/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087-human-overall>
  a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis;
  prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/human-reviewer/RV012>;
  prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/evaluation/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087>;
  prov:wasMemberOf <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/research-integrity-assessment/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087>;
  ripe:rationale "After checking all tabs, I have changed my mind and would rate this as serious concerns instead of some concerns.";
  ripe:resultOutcome "serious-concerns";
  tido:answers <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/overall-integrity-assessment-question/1.0.0> .

<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-hypothesis/RIPEA233158DEF9C3F087-inspectai-1-1>
