  ripe:rationale "One of the authors is associated with a retracted article; however, this article was retracted by the authors due to concerns about the completeness of β-blocker prescription data during the first year of the observation period. This suggests that the authors have conducted their own integrity checks of their work. See https://thorax.bmj.com/content/66/3/269";
  ripe:resultOutcome "no";
  tido:answers <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-question/research-team-related-concerns/1.0.0> .

<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-hypothesis/RIPEA478B1903A8898743-human-2-2>
  a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis;
  prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/human-reviewer/RV014>;
  prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/evaluation/RIPEA478B1903A8898743>;
  prov:wasMemberOf <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/research-integrity-assessment/RIPEA478B1903A8898743>;
  ripe:rationale "I agree with INSPECT-AI that study registration appears to be after the recruitment date: ISRCTN submission date is 27/09/2011 and registration date is 20/10/2011. Formal recruitment began on 2nd June 2011 and baseline data appear to have been collected from 11 August; however the date of first enrolment is listed in ISRCTN as 01/06/2011, so it appears that the authors have been 'honest' that the registration was retrospective. Ethics approval was granted on 17th May 2011 (Ref CSS/2011/029).";
  ripe:resultOutcome "no";
  tido:answers <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-question/study-registration/1.0.0> .

