  ripe:rationale "On trial registry, date of registration is 22/6/2015 and date of first enrollment is 02/06/2015. It also states 'No' to 'Prospective registration'. In the publication it states the study was carried out between June and September 2015 (not that recruitment occured until September 2015). The study was only 12 weeks long, so it is likely most (if not all) participants were recruited in June and this could of occurred before the trial was registered on 22nd June. Therefore, there are concerns about timing of registration.";
  ripe:resultOutcome "unclear";
  tido:answers <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-question/study-registration/1.0.0> .

