  ripe:rationale "I agree with INSPECT-AI that the authors are associated with retractions. The two authors are associated with the same retracted paper. This appears to have been retracted by the author group due to coding errors in the analysis. This suggests the author group have integrity and I think it's unclear whether this causes integrity concerns for the main article.";
  ripe:resultOutcome "unclear";
