  ripe:rationale "I agree with INSPECT-AI that the registration date is retrospective; however, the entry in ISRCTN shows the submission date is 19th July 2016 (so only three weeks after recruitment start date of 27th June 2016). The registration date is 21st July 2016 but the overall study start date given in ISRCTN is 1st November 2015 and the first enrolment date is document in ISRTCN (so it appears the authors are transparent about the retrospective registration date). Ethics approval was granted on 29/02/2016, ref: 16/LO/0073";
  ripe:resultOutcome "no";
  tido:answers <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-question/study-registration/1.0.0> .

