  tido:supports <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-hypothesis/RIPEA231DE1E46AB0E524-human-1-2>,
    <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-hypothesis/RIPEA231DE1E46AB0E524-inspectai-1-2> .

