  ripe:concerns <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/work/10.1007%2Fs12011-017-1085-0>;
  tido:supports <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-kg/integrity-assessment-hypothesis/RIPEA4F5D57083F3F36E5-human-1-2>,
